; --cost: adjacent conversion pairs are dropped only when the transaction has a non-conversion posting
2026-01-01 only conversion postings, 2
    equity:conversion  2 X
    equity:conversion  -2 X

2026-01-02 only conversion postings, 3
    equity:conversion  1 EUR
    equity:conversion  2 EUR
    equity:conversion  -3 EUR

2026-01-03 two pairs and a regular posting
    equity:conversion  1 EUR
    equity:conversion  -1 EUR
    a  3 EUR
    equity:conversion  1 EUR
    equity:conversion  -4 EUR

2026-01-04 virtual regular counts
    equity:conversion  1 EUR
    equity:conversion  -1 EUR
    (v)  5 EUR

2026-01-05 tags still apply when all are conversion
    equity:conversion  1 EUR ; _conversion-posting:
    equity:conversion  -1 EUR ; _conversion-posting:

2026-01-06 one tag, rest paired
    equity:conversion  1 EUR ; _conversion-posting:
    equity:conversion  -1 EUR
